#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0033 expect=skipped domain=DS
#note "DSTPT is present and populated, DSTPTNUM is present but missing -> the row would fire; DS is a member of the included EVENTS class, so ONLY the Domains.Exclude [DS] rejects. Pinned on behalf of SD0034's identical [DS] block."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DS class=EVENTS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col DSSEQ    type=Num
col DSTERM   type=Char
col DSTPT    type=Char
col DSTPTNUM type=Num
---
S1 | DS | 001 | 1 | DISPOSITION EVENT | PRE-DOSE | .
